# Well-formed Turtle that carries no ex:category/ex:worker classification
# predicates -- used by manufacture_test.rs's
# classify_artifact_valid_turtle_missing_predicates_returns_ok_none to prove
# a syntactically valid but unrelated file returns a real Ok(None), not
# collapsed into either I/O or MalformedTtl refusal.
@prefix ex: <urn:example:> .
ex:s ex:unrelatedPredicate "v" .
